From: Hummingbird <hummingbird@redhat.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Backport CVE-2026-9496 fix to vendored pacote 21.0.1 and 21.0.4

Upstream: https://github.com/npm/pacote/commit/ce804fb1647fe1699b2f87efd01ea9f4efed8508

Fix ReDoS in addGitSha via crafted spec.rawSpec value.  The `/#.*$/`
regex replacement in `lib/util/add-git-sha.js` is replaced with an
`indexOf`/`slice` approach that avoids catastrophic backtracking.

Reflected as updated checksums in yarn.lock for the two in-tree
pacote versions (21.0.1 and 21.0.4); the zip files in the yarn
cache tarball carry the patched sources.

diff --git a/yarn.lock b/yarn.lock
--- a/yarn.lock
+++ b/yarn.lock
@@ -27783,7 +27783,7 @@
     tar: "npm:^7.4.3"
   bin:
     pacote: bin/index.js
-  checksum: 10c0/df4755db6a11982371e5c37763364dbb6cb281de911221a079d896bbb4dbef3411b01c3a13f4489eac1b992984850f7888bbc4bcdd8c01bdd610918b8a4781fc
+  checksum: 10c0/5c97ce60b64afc3e4ab0399d03fd1271db2d821a0e83870c9934b64dd50c4256323c384413c4116c0f038b29b916e64a2e9954c39badf7cdd87245e31aa50761
   languageName: node
   linkType: hard
 
@@ -27810,7 +27810,7 @@
     tar: "npm:^7.4.3"
   bin:
     pacote: bin/index.js
-  checksum: 10c0/42ba048d7f463d2f0683bc7632a64c921d164463c17fb94b48ff412c5b852d2f58bb11bb510e0fb990d851e5c1f37f5669d20881b229797baba865b1c70a9fb6
+  checksum: 10c0/daa70bc650f8b758ff2705ab4597c570bf8761c834dd7d44e353540b8540c17822f5eea05d9fc4ff6b2d2a8da29e7866d69a42ef515889d10801932602e44a5d
   languageName: node
   linkType: hard
 
